oop.example:
```python
class Student:
    def __init__(self, name, roll_no):
        self.name = name          # Attribute
        self._roll_no = roll_no   # Encapsulated

    def introduce(self):
        return f'I am {self.name}, Roll No: {self._roll_no}'

s = Student('Govind', 101)
print(s.introduce())
```

